        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana WBC1310, 13-1/4\" Corner Solid Brass Wire Basket </b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA wire basket such as this is perfect for all sorts of storage needs. It is easy to install and is available in beautiful finishes ranging from modern to traditional. Made by Deltana, the WBC1310 13-1/4\" wire basket is constructed out of solid brass with the attention to high quality for which Deltana is known. It is designed to make the most out of corner space and installs easily to the wall.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-WBC1310-specifications.gif?v=1704354543\" width=\"405\" height=\"284\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana WBC1310 13-1/4\" Corner Wire Basket Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/collections/bathroom-hardware-1\"><b>Deltana Wire Baskets</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the WBC1310 Solid Brass Corner Basket:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 13-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 10-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Depth: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-WBC1310.pdf?v=1704262292\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana WBC1310 13-1/4\" Corner Wire Basket Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 basket, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>",
